        "subject": "LU-20942 tests: skip conf-sanity 73e, 88a, 250 on old servers",
        "message": "LU-20942 tests: skip conf-sanity 73e, 88a, 250 on old servers\n\nconf-sanity test_73e, test_88a and test_250 fail every time against\n2.17.0 servers.  Each tests a server change that landed after 2.17.0,\nand its version check, if any, does not exclude 2.17.0:\n\n- test_73e remounts the MGS and expects the targets to rebuild its\n  NID tables, which 089f438ba9a5 added, but only checks for 2.16.57\n- test_88a has no version check for the tunefs.lustre fix it tests\n- test_250 checks for 2.16.54.86, but lcfg_erase only erases the\n  fsname params since f5e198dc687a\n\nCheck for the commit that added each, and only skip the MGS remount\npart of test_73e.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=conf-sanity env=ONLY=\"73e 88a 250\",HONOR_EXCEPT=y serverversion=2.17\nFixes: 089f438ba9a5 (\"LU-19692 mgc: notify MGS about target NIDs after reconnect\")\nFixes: 23b31c5db51a (\"LU-20360 utils: fix tunefs.lustre dropping mountfsoptions\")\nFixes: f5e198dc687a (\"LU-18951 utils: lctl lcfg_erase erase fsname params\")\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5.5 ltvm,llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I343bcbfb0215b2c2ef744a3241d488cc183ebbe5\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/69635\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Jian Yu <yujian@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Sohei Koyama <skoyama@ddn.com>\nReviewed-by: Mikhail Pershin <mike.tappro@gmail.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
